Package: cybroid-edition-engineering
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), kicad, kicad-symbols, kicad-footprints, freecad, librecad, ngspice, octave, python3-numpy, python3-scipy, python3-matplotlib, jupyter-notebook, arduino
Description: CybroidOS Engineering: for electronics, CAD and science
 Design, simulation and analysis: KiCad with its symbol and footprint
 libraries, FreeCAD, LibreCAD, ngspice, GNU Octave, Python with NumPy,
 SciPy and Matplotlib in Jupyter, and the Arduino IDE.
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
